# User interface texts: dropinc (first draft per docs/glossar-i18n.md; keys are never renamed)

dropinc-assembler-quelltext-laesst-sich-in-basic = Assembler source code cannot be included in BASIC. Machine code belongs in an assembler program via .incbin.

dropinc-basic-kennt-kein-incbin-binaere-daten = BASIC has no .incbin. Binary data can only be included through assembler source code or as a medium (DATA lines).

dropinc-basic-quelltext-laesst-sich-in-assembler = BASIC source code cannot be included in assembler. Convert it with “Convert to assembler ...” or include an assembler program

dropinc-der-dateiname-enthaelt-ein-anfuehrungszeichen-das = The file name contains a quotation mark – the assembler does not accept that in include paths. Please rename the file.

dropinc-der-dateiname-enthaelt-steuerzeichen-bitte-umbenennen = The file name contains control characters – please rename it.

dropinc-die-datei-ist-ein-anderer-basic = The file is another BASIC dialect (different extension) than the target – they do not fit together

dropinc-projektdatei-und-diskettenimages-lassen-sich-nicht = A project file and disk images cannot be included in source code

dropinc-strukturiertes-basic-sbas-wird-nicht-unterstuetzt = Structured BASIC (.sbas) is not supported – please include .bas only

dropinc-ordner-und-nicht-vorhandene-dateien-lassen-sich = Folders and files that do not exist cannot be included

dropinc-eine-datei-laesst-sich-nicht-in-sich = A file cannot be included in itself

dropinc-die-datei-liegt-ausserhalb-des-projekts = The file is outside the project

dropinc-hier-gibt-es-kein-einbinden-nur-in = Including is not possible here: only in assembler and BASIC source code

dropinc-diese-datei-ist-schon-eingebunden-zeile-n = This file is already included (line { $n }) – nothing inserted

dropinc-include-nur-einmal = #include (only once)

dropinc-ohne-ladeadresse-2 = without load address (, 2)
